sequenceDiagram
    participant G as Gateway gRPC client
    participant P as Plugin gRPC server
    G->>P: HTTP/2 PluginService/Call(capability, JSON)
    activate P
    P->>P: validate capability and JSON schema
    P-->>G: CallResponse(JSON payload or typed code/message)
    deactivate P
    Note over G,P: context deadline or cancellation cancels this RPC
